#: menus.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Copy currently selected text onto the clipboard. </action> This "
"command is unavailable if there is no text currently selected. If this "
"action is used in the Form Designer, currently selected widget or group of "
"widgets are copied onto the clipboard."
